  message: "Fixed in PR #2276 (497ba9219): go.yaml receiver_address_of + cfg.address_taking_members + ddg_build._address_taking_members read the method's declaration, so t.Get with a *Box receiver is an address-take of t. Live re-run on dev 3c109b3aa: filed repro go_method_value_ptr -> inconclusive rc 4 (was confirmed 0; the walk's refutation is withheld under the exposed-referent rule), control go_method_value_ptr_ctrl violated rc 1. Shape 3 (value in the slot a helper returns) fixed by WI-zaboh in the same PR (go_helper_slot confirmed 0 -> violated 1). Shape 2 (terminating-summary callee that stores into its argument) was not reproduced. 10/10 mutations killed. Residuals filed as their own items: builtins.print(file=) treated as terminating; stdlib pointer receivers (url.URL.String) not seen; JS/TS static field initialisers counted as capture scopes."  # a01c
